{"task_id": "Mbpp/12", "solution": "```python\ndef _calculate_row_sum(row):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of elements in a single row.\"\"\"\n    return sum(row)\n\ndef sort_matrix(matrix):\n    \"\"\"Sorts a given matrix in ascending order based on the sum of its rows.\"\"\"\n    row_sums_with_rows = []\n    for row in matrix:\n        current_row_sum = _calculate_row_sum(row)\n        row_sums_with_rows.append((current_row_sum, row))\n\n    row_sums_with_rows.sort(key=lambda item: item[0])\n\n    sorted_matrix = [row for row_sum, row in row_sums_with_rows]\n    return sorted_matrix\n```"}
