{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "```python\nimport math\n\ndef _binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n, k).\"\"\"\n    return math.factorial(n) // (math.factorial(k) * math.factorial(n - k))\n\ndef sum_Of_product(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of C(n, k) * C(n, k+1) for k from 0 to n-1.\n    Handles edge cases for n=0 and n=1 as specified.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(n):\n        term1 = _binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n        term2 = _binomial_coefficient(n, k + 1)\n        total_sum += term1 * term2\n    return total_sum\n```\n"}
