{"task_id": "Mbpp/605", "solution": "```python\ndef prime_num(number):\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if a given integer is a prime number.\n    Returns True if the number is prime, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number <= 1:\n        return False\n    if number == 2:\n        return True\n    if number % 2 == 0:\n        return False\n    i = 3\n    while i * i <= number:\n        if number % i == 0:\n            return False\n        i += 2\n    return True\n```"}
