{"task_id": "Mbpp/639", "solution": "def sample_nam(names: list[str]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Sums the length of names after excluding those starting with a lowercase letter.\n    Processes each name to filter and accumulate lengths.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for name in names:\n        # Determine if the name starts with a lowercase letter, consistent with _starts_with_lowercase helper.\n        starts_with_lowercase = False\n        if name: # Only check the first character if the name is not empty.\n            if 'a' <= name[0] <= 'z':\n                starts_with_lowercase = True\n\n        # If the name does NOT start with a lowercase letter, add its length to the total.\n        if not starts_with_lowercase:\n            total_sum += len(name)\n    return total_sum"}
