{"task_id": "Mbpp/745", "solution": "```python\ndef divisible_by_digits(startnum: int, endnum: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds numbers within a range where each number is divisible by every non-zero digit it contains.\n    Numbers containing '0' are excluded from the result.\n    \"\"\"\n    result = []\n    for num in range(startnum, endnum + 1):\n        s_num = str(num)\n        is_valid_num = True\n        for digit_char in s_num:\n            digit_val = int(digit_char)\n            if digit_val == 0:\n                is_valid_num = False\n                break\n            if num % digit_val != 0:\n                is_valid_num = False\n                break\n\n        if is_valid_num:\n            result.append(num)\n\n    return result\n```\n"}
