{"task_id": "Mbpp/757", "solution": "```python\ndef count_reverse_pairs(string_list: list[str]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts unique pairs of strings where one is the reverse of the other,\n    ensuring each string participates in only one case-sensitive pair.\n    \"\"\"\n    pair_count = 0\n    unprocessed_strings = set(string_list)\n\n    while unprocessed_strings:\n        current_string = unprocessed_strings.pop()\n        reversed_string = current_string[::-1]\n\n        if current_string != reversed_string and reversed_string in unprocessed_strings:\n            pair_count += 1\n            unprocessed_strings.remove(reversed_string)\n\n    return pair_count\n```"}
