{"task_id": "Mbpp/770", "solution": "```python\ndef odd_num_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the fourth power of the first 'n' odd natural numbers.\n    It iterates 'n' times, computing (2*i + 1)^4 and adding to a running total.\"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        current_odd_number = 2 * i + 1\n        fourth_power = current_odd_number ** 4\n        total_sum += fourth_power\n    return total_sum\n```"}
