{"task_id": "Mbpp/778", "solution": "```python\ndef pack_consecutive_duplicates(input_list):\n    \"\"\"\n    Packs consecutive duplicate elements from a list into sublists.\n    Elements without consecutive duplicates are placed into single-element sublists.\n    \"\"\"\n    output_list = []\n    if not input_list:\n        return output_list\n\n    current_sublist = [input_list[0]]\n\n    for element in input_list[1:]:\n        if element == current_sublist[-1]:\n            current_sublist.append(element)\n        else:\n            output_list.append(current_sublist)\n            current_sublist = [element]\n\n    output_list.append(current_sublist)\n    return output_list\n```"}
