{"task_id": "Mbpp/805", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import List, Union\n\nclass InnerList:\n    \"\"\"Represents a single inner list with numerical elements.\n    It provides functionality to calculate the sum of its elements.\"\"\"\n    _elements: List[Union[int, float]]\n\n    def __init__(self, elements: List[Union[int, float]]):\n        \"\"\"Initializes an InnerList with the provided numerical elements.\"\"\"\n        self._elements = elements\n\n    def calculate_sum(self) -> Union[int, float]:\n        \"\"\"Calculates and returns the sum of the elements in this list.\"\"\"\n        return sum(self._elements)\n\n    def get_elements(self) -> List[Union[int, float]]:\n        \"\"\"Returns the raw list of elements stored in this object.\"\"\"\n        return self._elements\n\nclass ListOfLists:\n    \"\"\"Manages a collection of InnerList objects.\n    It identifies the inner list with the highest sum of elements.\"\"\"\n    _inner_lists: List[InnerList]\n\n    def __init__(self, list_of_lists_data: List[List[Union[int, float]]]):\n        \"\"\"Constructs ListOfLists by converting raw sub-lists into InnerList objects.\"\"\"\n        self._inner_lists = [InnerList(data) for data in list_of_lists_data]\n\n    def get_highest_sum_list(self) -> List[Union[int, float]]:\n        \"\"\"Iterates through inner lists to find and return the one with the maximum sum.\"\"\"\n        max_sum = float('-inf')\n        highest_sum_list_elements: List[Union[int, float]] = []\n\n        for inner_list_obj in self._inner_lists:\n            current_sum = inner_list_obj.calculate_sum()\n            if current_sum > max_sum:\n                max_sum = current_sum\n                highest_sum_list_elements = inner_list_obj.get_elements()\n        return highest_sum_list_elements\n\ndef max_sum_list(input_list_of_lists: List[List[Union[int, float]]]) -> List[Union[int, float]]:\n    \"\"\"Identifies and returns the inner list with the highest sum of elements.\n    It orchestrates the use of ListOfLists and InnerList classes to achieve this.\"\"\"\n    list_of_lists_obj = ListOfLists(input_list_of_lists)\n    return list_of_lists_obj.get_highest_sum_list()\n```"}
