{"task_id": "Mbpp/96", "solution": "```python\ndef divisor(number):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the total number of positive divisors for a given integer.\n    It assumes the input is a non-negative integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    # Iterate from 1 up to the square root of the number.\n    # If i is a divisor, then number/i is also a divisor.\n    for i in range(1, int(number**0.5) + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            if i * i == number:\n                count += 1\n            else:\n                count += 2\n    return count\n```"}
