{"task_id": "Mbpp/111", "solution": "```python\ndef common_in_nested_lists(nested_list: list[list]) -> set:\n    \"\"\"Finds common elements in all sub-lists of a nested list using set intersection.\"\"\"\n    if not nested_list:\n        return set()\n\n    common_elements = set(nested_list[0])\n    if not common_elements and len(nested_list) > 1:\n        return set()\n\n    for sub_list in nested_list[1:]:\n        if not sub_list:\n            return set()\n\n        current_set = set(sub_list)\n        common_elements = common_elements.intersection(current_set)\n\n        if not common_elements:\n            return set()\n\n    return common_elements\n```"}
