{"task_id": "Mbpp/166", "solution": "```python\ndef find_even_pair(input_list: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Counts unique pairs in a list whose bitwise XOR results in an even number.\n    It iterates through all unique pairs and checks their XOR result's parity.\n    \"\"\"\n    even_pair_count = 0\n    n = len(input_list)\n\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            # Compute the bitwise XOR for the pair.\n            xor_result = input_list[i] ^ input_list[j]\n            # Increment count if the XOR result is even.\n            if xor_result % 2 == 0:\n                even_pair_count += 1\n    return even_pair_count\n```"}
