{"task_id": "Mbpp/265", "solution": "```python\ndef list_split(input_list: list, n: int) -> list[list]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Splits an input list into 'n' sub-lists.\n    Each sub-list 'k' (0-indexed) contains elements from the original list\n    whose index modulo 'n' equals k.\n\n    Args:\n        input_list: The list of elements to be split.\n        n: The integer split parameter (must be positive).\n\n    Returns:\n        A list of 'n' sub-lists.\n\n    Raises:\n        ValueError: If 'n' is not a positive integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(n, int) or n <= 0:\n        raise ValueError(\"Split parameter 'n' must be a positive integer.\")\n\n    result = [[] for _ in range(n)]\n    for i, element in enumerate(input_list):\n        result[i % n].append(element)\n    return result\n```\n"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "```python\ndef _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n, k).\n    \"\"\"\n    if k < 0 or k > n:\n        return 0\n    if k == 0 or k == n:\n        return 1\n    if k > n // 2:\n        k = n - k\n\n    res = 1\n    for i in range(k):\n        res = res * (n - i) // (i + 1)\n    return res\n\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients for a given positive integer n.\n    \"\"\"\n    sum_coeff = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        sum_coeff += _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n    return sum_coeff\n```"}
