{"task_id": "Mbpp/299", "solution": "```python\ndef max_aggregate(data: list[tuple[str, int]]) -> tuple[str, int]:\n    # Aggregate scores for each unique name into a dictionary.\n    aggregated_scores = {}\n    for name, score in data:\n        aggregated_scores[name] = aggregated_scores.get(name, 0) + score\n\n    # Find the name and its score with the highest total aggregate, assuming valid input.\n    max_name, max_score = next(iter(aggregated_scores.items()))\n    for name, total_score in aggregated_scores.items():\n        if total_score > max_score:\n            max_score = total_score\n            max_name = name\n\n    return (max_name, max_score)\n```"}
