{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "```python\ndef find_lucas(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the n'th Lucas number using an iterative approach.\n    Handles base cases L(0)=2, L(1)=1, and iteratively computes for n > 1.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n\n    # Initialize for L(0) and L(1)\n    a, b = 2, 1\n\n    # Iterate from L(2) up to L(n)\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        next_lucas = a + b\n        a = b\n        b = next_lucas\n    return b\n```"}
