{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "class PerrinSequence:\n    \"\"\"Manages generation and caching of Perrin numbers.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._cache = {0: 3, 1: 0, 2: 2}\n\n    def getPerrin(self, index: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the Perrin number for a given index, using memoization.\"\"\"\n        if index in self._cache:\n            return self._cache[index]\n\n        # Calculate P(index) for index > 2 using the recurrence relation.\n        self._cache[index] = self.getPerrin(index - 2) + self.getPerrin(index - 3)\n        return self._cache[index]\n\ndef cal_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers from P(0) to P(n).\n    Assumes n is a non-negative integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    perrin_sequence = PerrinSequence()\n    total_sum = 0\n\n    # Iterate from 0 to n (inclusive) and sum each Perrin number.\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        total_sum += perrin_sequence.getPerrin(i)\n\n    return total_sum"}
