{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "```python\ndef cal_sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of Perrin numbers from P(0) up to P(n).\n    Uses an iterative approach with memoization for efficiency.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Initialize a list to store Perrin numbers up to n and the total sum.\n    # The list is pre-sized to allow direct indexing for memoization.\n    perrin_numbers = [0] * (n + 1)\n    total_sum = 0\n\n    # Establish the base cases for the Perrin sequence: P(0)=3, P(1)=0, P(2)=2.\n    if n >= 0:\n        perrin_numbers[0] = 3\n        total_sum += perrin_numbers[0]\n    if n >= 1:\n        perrin_numbers[1] = 0\n        total_sum += perrin_numbers[1]\n    if n >= 2:\n        perrin_numbers[2] = 2\n        total_sum += perrin_numbers[2]\n\n    # Iterate from P(3) up to P(n), calculating each Perrin number\n    # using the recurrence relation P(i) = P(i-2) + P(i-3) and adding it to the sum.\n    for i in range(3, n + 1):\n        perrin_numbers[i] = perrin_numbers[i-2] + perrin_numbers[i-3]\n        total_sum += perrin_numbers[i]\n\n    return total_sum\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/453", "solution": "```python\ndef sumofFactors(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of all even factors for a given positive integer.\n    It iterates through numbers from 1 up to the input number to find and sum even factors.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_even_factors_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, number + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:  # Check if i is a factor\n            if i % 2 == 0:  # Check if the factor i is even\n                total_even_factors_sum += i\n    return total_even_factors_sum\n```"}
